      "decision": "new canonical original; municipal or landfill context",
      "description": "Cadillac City Council minutes, April 19, 2010. Page 3, motions 2010.088 and 2010.089, adopt 4.5% water and sewer rate increases effective July 1, 2010. Pages 4–5, motion 2010.096, award Environmental Recycling Group household-hazardous-waste collection at a $725 site fee plus $0.83 per pound for 2010–2011, with a two-year option; County/City shares are 60%/40%. These are rate and service-award records, not leachate revenue, payment or delivery to Cadillac WWTP. Page 5 Miscellaneous File No. 869 concerns delinquent taxes, not the leachate agreement File No. 842. Seven pages, including a blank final page."
    },
