      "description": "Cadillac City Council minutes, October 18, 2010. Pages 2–4 continue the Wexford Solid Waste Management Plan amendment hearing, discussing American Waste, proposed landfill sale, expanded waste imports, flow control, tipping fees and landfill life. Speakers describe potential economic effects; this file contains no plan-amendment adoption. November 1 minutes, pp1–2, subsequently approve corrections describing future flow-control options upon sale or after a set period. Solid-waste flow control is not wastewater flow. No completed sale, leachate delivery, carrier ticket, invoice or PFAS result is supplied. Six pages, including a blank final page."
    },
