      "decision": "new canonical original; municipal or landfill context",
      "description": "Cadillac City Council minutes, November 1, 2010. Pages 4–5 record discussion of American Waste’s proposed acquisition of Wexford County Landfill, conditional rate decreases, closure/post-closure obligations and required relocation of trash from an unlined cell. Page 5, motion 2010.248, approves the 2009 Solid Waste Management Plan amendment 3–2. This establishes Council action and attributed statements, not a completed sale, waste relocation, actual tipping payment or delivery to Cadillac WWTP. Pages 1–2 approve corrected October 18 minutes describing future flow-control options; corrected p5 attributes the County’s flow-control pledge to John Divozzo. Seven pages, including a blank final page."
    },
