      "decision": "new canonical original; municipal or landfill context",
      "description": "Cadillac City Council minutes, December 6, 2010. Page 2 discusses curbside recycling as an option in the City’s Allied Waste contract. Page 3, motion 2010.267 / Resolution 1957, approves invasive-aquatic-species millage ballot language for February 22, 2011 by 3–2; a preceding discussion paragraph says 2010, while the operative motion says 2011. Page 4 records a public commenter’s concern about potentially duplicated legal bills and the City Manager’s promise to look into it, not verified duplicate billing or original invoices. This is municipal recycling/milfoil context, not Allied Waste leachate hauling or a WWTP delivery. Five pages, including a blank final page."
